  "body": "Embrace modern coastal living with this exceptional brand-new residence, perfectly positioned in the vibrant heart of Long Bay. Thoughtfully designed to blend contemporary style with versatile functionality, the home offers a well-crafted layout tailored for multi-generational families and refined everyday living.\r\n\r\nAs you enter from the welcoming front porch into the foyer, a stylish staircase leads to the upper level while the main floor draws you naturally inside. Moving straight through, the home opens into a light-filled open-plan living and dining domain anchored by a cozy fireplace. The state-of-the-art kitchen is supported by a discreet scullery, keeping food preparation effortless and organized. Glass sliding doors open seamlessly from the dining and living area directly onto the outdoor deck, ideal for summer BBQs and alfresco entertaining.\r\n\r\nDesigned with ultimate flexibility in mind, this ground level features its own ensuite—perfect for guests or live-in parents. A separate lounge offers a quiet retreat, complemented by a convenient powder room, and a double internal-access garage. Upstairs reveals an exceptional layout—featuring three master suites complete with its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, an additional semi-ensuite bedroom, plus a flexible study and a family lounge.\r\n\r\nThe Long Bay lifestyle offers a harmonious balance of nature and urban convenience. You are just moments from the golden sands of Long Bay Beach, regional park trails, and vibrant village cafes. For commuters, a short drive brings you to the Albany Park & Ride station, providing bus connections directly into Auckland’s CBD.\r\n\r\nOffering balanced proportions, low-maintenance modern finishes, and smart separation of spaces, this sophisticated home represents a wonderful opportunity to establish your future in one of Long Bay’s most desirable coastal neighbourhoods.",
